{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99709","id":2201074019,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6DMblj","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99709","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99709.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99709.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99709","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99709/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99709/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99709/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/344d678bbecf15fe76407e635c30713aef79fc3d","number":99709,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Buildsystem] Tweak cache sizes for CI","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The default cache limit of 7 GiB gives a lot of space for caching but is significantly larger than needed for most targets for CI\r\n\r\nWith successive builds changes build up, unnecessarily increasing cache use for each entry. This is especially true with major changes to core headers etc.\r\n\r\nThis was the cause of the issues resolved by:\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96752\r\n\r\nThe limits were chosen from a complete rebuild with an empty cache going in, then doubling the needed space (and generally rounding up), for a few cases the limit was left at 7 GiB as the cache space required was already more than half of that, or around that limit. This should give us space for growth, and allow using the cache for back-and-forth changes, while still trying to save space. Things add up and with 18 artifacts per PR and run (all but two of which now reduced in size) something as small as a few tens of MiB per artifact is a lot of saved space.\r\n\r\nThe specific cache sizes are fully up for tweaking, picked these as a mix between giving room for growth and clamping at a reasonable limit.\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"ht